  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, height: 314, marginTop: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 370, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 9, padding: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>安全边界</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>JWT + PBKDF2；admin/analyst/department三角色；科室范围在服务端强制；未登录401、越权403、危险问数403。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>仍有默认口令、无HTTPS、无限流、无渗透测试等生产缺口。</Text>
