    <Box style={{ width: 370, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 9, padding: 18 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>数据对账</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>六源59,922行/0错误；八DWS共7,679行；ADS 26,136行；月度K16与DWS总收入44,260,283.80元一致。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>这些是对账证据，不代表真实医院业务验收。</Text>
